WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.650
- I'm Machine Gun Kelly.

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:03.450
I'm here on the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:05.290
and she's actually gonna help me surprise

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:06.360
one of my favorite fans.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.560
She's nine years old, about to turn 10,

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.540
and I got her birthday invite.

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:14.240
So, me and Chevelle actually
met onstage for the first time

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:19.130
when I saw her, she was singing
every word to all my songs,

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:22.120
and I brought her on stage,
and she stole the show

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:27.120
in front of 10,000 people,
just play the clip.

00:00:27.784 --> 00:00:30.498
♪ I can't get enough of it ♪

00:00:30.498 --> 00:00:33.759
♪ I swear to God, I never fall in love ♪

00:00:33.759 --> 00:00:37.960
♪ I never fall in love, but
I can't get enough of it ♪

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:41.190
Since I couldn't make it to
the actual birthday party,

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:42.300
I'm gonna surprise her on here.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:46.160
So, she thinks she's talking
to a producer on the show,

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.680
however, it's just me.

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:52.170
- Hey, so I heard you're a
really big Machine Gun Kelly fan.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:55.860
- I am, I love him so much
that I'm even wearing the shirt

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:58.420
that I wore to the concert.

00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:02.330
I love his music so much,
'cause it's so good.

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:05.990
And I like to listen to it in the car,

00:01:05.990 --> 00:01:08.890
and I love to dance to it and sing to it.

00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:10.780
- Well, I do have another producer here

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:12.470
that just is gonna chat with you

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:16.067
and ask you a couple
more formal questions.

00:01:16.067 --> 00:01:16.900
- Okay.

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:20.060
(dramatic music)

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:20.893
- Hi!

00:01:20.893 --> 00:01:25.870
(dramatic music)
- Hi.

00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:26.890
- Last time I saw you,

00:01:26.890 --> 00:01:28.510
we were rocking the stage together,

00:01:28.510 --> 00:01:31.380
and you did way better of a job than me.

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:33.290
I should have just let you
finish the whole show off.

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:35.090
You did so good.

00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:36.290
How old are you turning?

00:01:37.231 --> 00:01:38.330
- 10.

00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:39.330
- You're turning 10?

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:42.770
Okay, so I got the birthday invite.

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:45.610
I actually have to go out
of the country tomorrow,

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:47.830
but since I can't be there,

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:50.773
can I sing something for you instead?

00:01:54.751 --> 00:01:59.090
♪ Happy Birthday to you ♪

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:03.362
♪ Happy Birthday to you ♪

00:02:03.362 --> 00:02:07.629
♪ Happy Birthday to you ♪

00:02:07.629 --> 00:02:12.629
♪ Happy Birthday to you, Chevelle, yeah ♪

00:02:13.035 --> 00:02:15.618
(upbeat music)

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:22.540
Happy 10th Birthday, Chevelle.

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:26.020
Thank for rocking with me
and being down with my music.

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:27.120
I really do appreciate that,

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:29.790
and that memory you made with me on stage

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:30.840
will stick with me forever,

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:33.740
so I really am very appreciative of you.

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:37.830
I also, before I go, did
get you a birthday present.

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:42.570
So, could you guys bring
in the birthday present?

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:45.973
Something for you to hold on to from me.

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:51.750
It's my signature guitar,
so you can hang it up,

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:53.500
or you can learn to play
it, or whatever you want,

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:57.463
but that's my thank you for your life.

00:02:58.671 --> 00:03:03.671
- Thank you.
(Chevelle crying)

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:07.080
- As you grow in this life,

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.070
and as things try to take away your light,

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:11.160
just hold onto it and
protect your light, okay?

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:13.960
Don't let people tell you
what to like, or what to do,

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:14.970
or how to be.

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:18.850
You are a light soul,
and just hold on to that,

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:20.650
and protect that, okay?

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:22.120
And happy 10th birthday.

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:24.160
I love you very much.

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:24.993
- Thank you.
- Bye.

00:03:28.061 --> 00:03:29.571
- Bye.
(bells chiming)

00:03:29.571 --> 00:03:33.890
- Okay, well, I'm gonna go
cry for two hours in my room

00:03:33.890 --> 00:03:37.610
from cuteness overload.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:39.760
Thank you, Kelly, for
helping us put that together.

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:41.471
Chevelle, happy birthday,

00:03:41.471 --> 00:03:43.971
and I'm gonna go wipe all my tears.

00:03:43.971 --> 00:03:48.971
(upbeat music)
(bells chiming)

